WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.820 line:90%,end
A month later, Elyra was a completely different place.

2
00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.550 line:90%,end
The islands were in bloom, and the bridges glowed with light.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.770 line:90%,end
The people of the twenty-three capsules had built new homes on the islands.

4
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:16.790 line:90%,end
The former Shadow was planting a seed in the castle garden for the first time.

5
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.130 line:90%,end
You should have a name now. Shadow doesn't suit you.

6
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:27.530 line:90%,end
I've thought about it. Let my name be Tomorrow. Because from now on, I'll always look toward tomorrow.

7
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:33.350 line:90%,end
Doctor Ekin's crystal heart shone in the middle of the castle like a new sun.

8
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.670 line:90%,end
I have completed my mission.

9
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.570 line:90%,end
Humanity has begun again. And this time, with its heart.

10
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.960 line:90%,end
With his crystal creatures, Eray had become Elyra's guide.

11
00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.210 line:90%,end
Everyone called him Prince Eray.

12
00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:50.100 line:90%,end
Being a prince is nice, but I have just one complaint.

13
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.390 line:90%,end
The crown won't stay on my head, my hair is too curly.

14
00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:57.870 line:90%,end
In the garden, Aslı and Nyra were giving Sergeant a new rank.

15
00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:02.570 line:90%,end
Sergeant, you are hereby appointed Elyra's first Cat General!

16
00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.970 line:90%,end
And that morning, a tiny light stirred in AyShe's palm.

17
00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:09.830 line:90%,end
Good morning, AyShe. Did I sleep too long?

18
00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.500 line:90%,end
Pusula! You're back!

19
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:18.410 line:90%,end
AyShe and Eray watched their new world from the highest hill in Elyra.

20
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.460 line:90%,end
A long and happy life lay ahead of them.

21
00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:24.770 line:90%,end
AyShe, what do you think will happen next?

22
00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:29.300 line:90%,end
I don't know. But whatever happens, we'll be together.

23
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.900 line:90%,end
Just then, Pusula's light flickered again.

24
00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.160 line:90%,end
AyShe. A signal is coming from the sky. From very far away. From Earth.

25
00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:43.420 line:90%,end
And deep in the clouds, the small red light blinked once more.

